NAME
    cd - change the working directory

SYNOPSIS
    cd path

DESCRIPTION
    Changes the current working directory. The path may be absolute
    (/bin), relative, or use . and .. -- and may cross the drive-1 mount
    (cd /d1). cd is an OS built-in command.

EXAMPLES
    cd /bin
    cd ..
    cd /d1

SEE ALSO
    pwd, dir, mkdir
